    {
      "id": "dronies-journey",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "A LOT OF MOVING PARTS",
      "body": "Dronies was the project that moved me from product design into creative direction and project leadership. Over the course of the production I worked across the brand, story, comic issues, web and product design, merchandise, launch creative and the larger visual direction while coordinating a team of roughly 30 contributors.\n\nMy role changed with the needs of the project. At different points I was creative director, art director, producer and the communication layer between artists, designers, developers, marketing, community, operations and external partners. That included working with the Solana Labs team around the partnership and keeping the launch moving smoothly.\n\nThis was deeply collaborative work. I did not create every artifact shown here; individual creative credits are attached wherever the archive has them. My contribution was setting direction, producing key work myself and keeping many disciplines moving as one project.",
      "source": "",
      "mediaRef": "",
      "href": "",
      "label": "",
      "projectId": "",
      "alt": "",
      "fit": "cover"
    },
